  "title": "Bluetooth SDP: fix protocol descriptor list parsing",
  "description": "The updated code uses a helper variable to check if all data elements have been processed\n\nThe issue occurs e.g. when using DES with1 16-bit length fields as in the attached [hfp_hf_demo.pklg](/uploads/d5eff0c4538b755ce3aa8249edcafd5f/hfp_hf_demo.pklg).\n\nHere, the original code shows 3 protocols \"L2CAP->RFCOMM->Unknown\", although only L2CAP and RFCOMM protocols exist.",
